<item>
            <title>[LU-20303] sanityn test_80b: timeout</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20303</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;This issue was created by maloo for S Buisson &amp;lt;sbuisson@ddn.com&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This issue relates to the following test suite run: &lt;a href=&quot;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/0aeb277e-871b-460b-bd36-fb2265be9549&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/0aeb277e-871b-460b-bd36-fb2265be9549&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;test_80b failed with the following error:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;preformatted panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;preformattedContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;Timeout occurred after 176 minutes, last suite running was sanityn
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Test session details:&lt;br/&gt;
clients: &lt;a href=&quot;https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/125447&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/125447&lt;/a&gt; - 4.18.0-553.117.1.el8_10.x86_64&lt;br/&gt;
servers: &lt;a href=&quot;https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/125447&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/125447&lt;/a&gt; - 4.18.0-553.117.1.el8_lustre.x86_64&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Problem is when sanityn test_80b is run multiple times in a row. At some point we can see errors like:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;preformatted panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;preformattedContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;rm: cannot remove &apos;/mnt/lustre2/d80b.sanityn/migrate_dir/link_file&apos;: Input/output error
rm: cannot remove &apos;/mnt/lustre2/d80b.sanityn/migrate_dir/link_file&apos;: Input/output error
rm: cannot remove &apos;/mnt/lustre2/d80b.sanityn/migrate_dir/link_file&apos;: Input/output error
rm: cannot remove &apos;/mnt/lustre2/d80b.sanityn/migrate_dir/link_file&apos;: Input/output error
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;And it finally blocks the test. The problem seems to be due to the fact that there are ongoing transactions on server side related to the migrate jobs. I am not sure how we could really guarantee there are no pending transactions on server side.&lt;/p&gt;





&lt;p&gt;VVVVVVV DO NOT REMOVE LINES BELOW, Added by Maloo for auto-association VVVVVVV&lt;br/&gt;
sanityn test_80b - Timeout occurred after 176 minutes, last suite running was sanityn&lt;/p&gt;</description>
